<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><text class="eyebrow">ORDER SERVICE</text><text class="page-title">说清问题，一起处理</text><view class="surface"><text class="heading">希望怎样处理</text><view class="two-options"><button class="variant {{type === 'refund' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-value="refund" bindtap="type">模拟退款</button><button class="variant {{type === 'replacement' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-value="replacement" bindtap="type">模拟补发</button></view><text class="field-label">问题类型</text><picker range="{{reasons}}" range-key="name" value="{{reasonIndex}}" bindchange="reason"><view class="input-box">{{reasons[reasonIndex].name}}　⌄</view></picker><text class="field-label">补充描述</text><textarea class="description-input" value="{{description}}" bindinput="description" maxlength="300" placeholder="仅填写模拟问题，不填写真实电话或地址。"/><text class="small muted">{{description.length}} / 300</text><text class="note">本轮凭证图片上传待接入，不把商品示意图当成真实损坏凭证。</text></view><view class="surface"><text class="heading">关联模拟金额 ¥{{order.totalText}}</text><text class="body-copy">原订单没有付款，实际退款为0元，不会真实补发。</text></view><button class="primary wide" bindtap="submit" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing}}">提交模拟售后申请</button></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
